               <text>
                  <paragraph>
                     <content styleCode="italics">
                        <content styleCode="bold">Inactive ingredients</content>
                     </content>
                     <br/>Acesulfame potassium, anhydrous citric acid,<br/>carboxymethylcellulose sodium, D&amp;C Red #33, FD&amp;C Red<br/>#40, flavors, glycerin, microcrystalline cellulose,<br/>polysorbate 80, propylene glycol, purified water, sodium<br/>benzoate, sucrose, and xanthan gum</paragraph>
               </text>
